<!--
  S0416: dedicated notification small icon for the cloud/link download foreground services.

  The shared ic_cloud_download carries android:tint="?attr/colorOnSurface" for its in-app button
  usages. A theme attribute cannot be resolved when the system inflates a foreground-service small
  icon outside the app theme, so Android 16 rejects the notification with
  CannotPostForegroundServiceNotificationException ("Bad notification for startForeground"). A
  status-bar icon must be plain white-on-transparent with no theme reference; this variant drops the
  ?attr tint. Same fix family as ic_notification_screen_capture (S0405).
-->
